Checked blame on every Go file at HEAD. 15,313 lines across 78 files. Now the answer.

Top five by surviving lines:

| # | Author | Lines | Share |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Eric Paris | 1917 | 12.5% |
| 2 | Noah Dietz | 1194 | 7.8% |
| 3 | Marcus Lindqvist | 1020 | 6.7% |
| 4 | Jonathan Reyna | 1004 | 6.6% |
